WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:06.480
I would like to share with you a few thoughts about this question of homosexuality.

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.240
Among the homosexuals,

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.040
there are people who take the view that what I do is no one's concern,

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.960
but it's my private business.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:18.960
However,

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:24.640
all things which take place in the sexual sphere are not the private affair of the individual,

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.840
but signify the life and death of the nation.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.480
The nation that produces a great many children stands to attain world domination.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.160
Another thing.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:41.920
The homosexual is a person who is categorically mentally ill.

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:50.200
I hope we can continue the work of racial purification that we are currently carrying out for Germany.

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:27.400
Considered weak,

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:28.520
perverted,

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:29.680
degenerate,

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:33.720
homosexuals were vigorously opposed by the Nazi regime,

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:37.280
which sought to prevent the spread of this contagious disease.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:44.240
While they weren't subjected to mass extermination like Jews,

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:47.320
they were victims of targeted persecution,

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.720
a piece of history the general public still knows very little about.

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:57.760
More than 50,000 homosexuals were sentenced to imprisonment.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:02.760
Between 5,000 to 10,000 were deported to a concentration camp.

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.000
Regardless of class,

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:05.680
age,

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:06.880
or ideology,

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:10.840
most of them would lose their lives.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:17.120
I suffered only due to this reason,

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:21.040
that I loved somebody that I loved a man.

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:23.520
Sometimes I say...

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:27.360
I can forgive the Germans,

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:28.960
but never forget.

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:30.200
Never forget.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:32.920
It is too difficult to forget.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.200
I never went to Linz again.

00:02:37.600 --> 00:02:38.800
My homeland vexes me.

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:40.920
I met two schoolmates once.

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:41.960
So Erwin,

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:42.800
said one of them,

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:44.200
did Hitler not gas you?

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:45.240
Nope,

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:45.600
I said.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:46.800
I got away from him.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:48.360
And the other one said,

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.560
vermin always comes back home.

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:55.360
I'll just tell you,

00:02:55.920 --> 00:02:57.840
coming home can be worse than going away.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:00.760
Nobody ever asked what I suffered.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:01.840
They didn't say,

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:03.000
you poor little thing,

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:04.000
or anything like that.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.960
They just regretted having reared something like me.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:17.800
The persecution of homosexuals by the Nazis took place in a particular historical context.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:23.440
Since 1871,

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:28.600
so-called unnatural sex had been punishable under the German Criminal Code.

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.640
Paragraph 175.

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:40.040
The unnatural fornication that is committed between two persons of the male sex,

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:42.160
or between persons and animals,

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.640
is punishable with imprisonment.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:49.200
Loss of civic rights may also be indicated.

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.400
After World War I,

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:59.600
the Weimar Republic that followed the Empire kept paragraph 175,

00:04:00.560 --> 00:04:03.360
but was relatively tolerant of homosexuals.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:09.560
Dozens of specialized publications were published for a male,

00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:10.160
female,

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:12.040
and transvestite readership.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:16.200
They featured articles,

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.400
naughty photos,

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:18.800
and even personals.

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:34.640
The country counted more than 1.5 million homosexuals and Berlin was considered the homosexual capital of Europe.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:51.400
Discretion

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:52.480
remained key.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.840
Homosexuals met up in public gardens,

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:58.640
for example.

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.080
In big city centers,

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:06.760
urinals provided readily available intimacy away from prying eyes.

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:21.800
Bathhouses also provided opportunities to meet new people without too much exposure.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.520
While arrests were frequent,

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:29.040
they rarely led to full prison terms.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:32.040
Usually less than three months.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:47.520
There

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:52.120
were many places in Berlin nightlife where homosexuals and lesbians could socialize.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.040
Kleist Casino,

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:56.320
Monocle,

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:57.640
Violetta,

00:05:58.360 --> 00:05:58.880
Mon Bijou,

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:00.360
Silhouette,

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.480
Domino or El Dorado,

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.720
made famous by its transvestite shows.

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:10.280
Bars,

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.080
dance halls,

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:13.280
cabarets were intellectuals,

00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:15.640
artists and bourgeois mingled,

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:17.320
living it up in the roaring

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:17.960
20s.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.440
Foreign tourists also,

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:25.080
or even just curious bystanders.

00:06:29.840 --> 00:06:33.360
A motley clientele gathered here to take part in carefree,

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:34.640
transgressive parties,

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.680
where everyone was allowed to live out their differences in total freedom.

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:42.360
It wasn't unusual to hear Das Lille Lied,

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:44.240
The Lavender Song,

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:48.440
a bona fide homosexual anthem composed in 1920.

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:56.200
Condemning the country's dramatic economic situation,

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:59.200
strangled by the repayment of war damages,

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:00.560
Adolf Hitler,

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:01.800
by the same token,

00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:06.400
promised to make Germany great again and restore order and morality.

00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:12.400
The Nazi Party was constantly gaining new members,

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:16.480
and its ideology was spreading to all strata of society.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:22.120
Accused of being perverted and decadent,

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.520
homosexuals were often targeted.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:31.080
A major thorn in the Nazi's side was Dr.

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.280
Magnus Hirschfeld.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:37.040
An adamant campaigner for the abolition of Paragraph 175,

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.400
Hirschfeld was one of the founders,

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:41.080
in 1897,

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:43.760
of the Scientific Humanitarian Committee,

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:47.080
the first homosexual association in history.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:50.480
In 1919 in central Berlin,

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:55.080
he also created an internationally renowned sexology institute,

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:58.360
a scientific research and documentation center.

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:06.120
He championed the idea that homosexuality was innate,

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:10.520
that a woman's soul was imprisoned in a man's body.

00:09:18.560 --> 00:09:23.040
1928,

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:23.400
29,

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:23.720
we went to Dr.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:24.120
Magda Söschert.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.080
I'll never forget that.

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:29.000
Where we hang our coats,

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:33.400
they're all bricks out of wood around the whole thing,

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:33.800
you know.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:36.640
I screamed out laughing.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:40.160
And the guy who was sitting on the desk,

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:40.920
well,

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:41.520
he says,

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:42.960
what are you laughing,

00:09:42.960 --> 00:09:43.320
mister?

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:45.440
This is our trademark,

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:46.040
period.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.040
At the Institute,

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:51.760
Hirschfeld welcomed homosexual and transgender patients.

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:55.880
He also organized the first sexual reassignment operations.

00:09:57.080 --> 00:09:59.240
A Jew and homosexual himself,

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:05.960
he was physically attacked by the Nazis on several occasions and was the object of numerous smear campaigns.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:12.840
I remember that in the news they always had caricatures of him.

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:14.440
Look at him,

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.720
the new paragraph 175,

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:19.480
making fun of them.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:31.360
The arrival of the Nazis into power resulted in radical change.

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:36.040
Hitler was named Chancellor on January 30,

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.320
1933.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:39.640
On March 20,

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:42.080
he proclaimed the advent of the Third Reich.

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.360
Immediately afterwards,

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:54.400
repressive measures were taken against political opponents and the program to purify Aryan society began.

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:57.360
On May 6th,

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:59.600
1933,

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:05.000
Magnus Hirschfeld's institute was ransacked by a group of Nazi students and members of the SA.

00:11:07.120 --> 00:11:09.240
Since he was traveling to France at the time,

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.040
the sexologist was safe,

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:16.680
but the books in the library were seized and burned a few days later in Opera Square.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:19.280
A bust in Hirschfeld's likeness,

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:20.920
carried at the end of a pike,

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:21.960
was set ablaze.

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:27.040
I was born in Berlin,

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:27.520
right?

00:11:28.960 --> 00:11:29.560
And I was a

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:33.040
Berliner. But when the Nazis came,

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:36.320
you had the feeling you are a stranger.

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:38.240
All of a sudden.

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:46.040
The hunt for homosexuals began immediately.

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:48.440
Some went into exile.

00:11:50.320 --> 00:11:52.800
In February 1933,

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:56.640
activist organizations were dissolved and magazines banned.

00:11:57.760 --> 00:11:59.280
A wave of arrests was made,

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:01.120
targeting repeat offenders,

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:02.160
transvestites,

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:03.480
and prostitutes.

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:09.240
Many clubs were closed down,

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.400
like the iconic El Dorado,

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:14.520
which was converted into a Nazi party headquarters.

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.240
In Columbia House,

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:25.320
a large prison in South Berlin,

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:30.000
homosexuals rubbed shoulders with political prisoners and common criminals.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:37.520
Many were also sent to the first concentration camps,

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:40.320
opened in 1933,

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:40.760
at Arenenberg,

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:42.760
Lichtenberg and Dachau.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:52.480
Hitler still had to restructure the military,

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:55.080
which raised the issue of the SA,

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:59.720
the paramilitary organization that accompanied the rise of the Nazi Party.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.360
It was led by Ernst Röhm,

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:09.360
who had been a loyal friend of the Fuhrer and supported him since 1919.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:15.240
Röhm's ambition then was to become head of the official army.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:22.800
Heinrich Himmler and Hermann Göring convinced Hitler that a coup was imminent.

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:27.080
At the end of June 1934,

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:33.200
Ernst Röhm and dozens of SA cadres were finally arrested before being executed for high treason.

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:36.880
Röhm's homosexuality,

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:38.800
shared by many of his lieutenants,

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:42.560
was also singled out as further proof of his moral decline.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:47.640
The Night of the Long Knives would soon have terrible consequences.

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:51.800
for all German homosexuals.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:53.400
Rome was a gay man.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:54.360
People knew that.

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.840
We read about what happened in the newspapers,

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:03.360
but it was never really established that Rome was actually fomenting rebellion.

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:05.760
And I don't believe it.

00:14:07.640 --> 00:14:09.000
They just wanted to get rid of him.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:12.800
And then nothing happened.

00:14:13.960 --> 00:14:15.400
That was from June to October.

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:16.560
To the end of the year,

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:17.640
nothing happened at all.

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:19.600
And then suddenly,

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.960
they hunted down all the gay people and locked them up.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:28.000
I was at my parents'

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:30.760
for Christmas 1934,

00:14:30.760 --> 00:14:33.520
and I received a citation for criminal activity.

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:37.080
I never defended myself against it.

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.000
Lots of people said,

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:39.720
yes,

00:14:39.840 --> 00:14:40.320
I'm gay,

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.760
but I didn't do this or that and so on.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.680
I was always so confident.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:46.440
I just said,

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:47.160
yes,

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:49.960
I lived with him and did this and did that.

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:53.520
I never thought I was harming anybody else.

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:00.880
The message sent to the German population was clear.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:03.920
All homosexuals were now targets.

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:05.120
Without exception,

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:10.000
between 1934 and 1936,

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.080
indictments multiplied by five.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:16.880
During interrogations,

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:22.080
mental and physical torture was used to make detainees confess to their crime.

00:15:24.520 --> 00:15:26.200
I am homosexual by inclination.

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.560
For purposes of sexual activity,

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:31.160
I have taken street boys from Alexander Platz.

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:33.600
I have masturbated with them in hallways.

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:36.040
I met five or six boys in total.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:37.440
To some,

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:38.480
I gave one Reichsmark,

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:39.920
otherwise B or cigarettes.

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:44.880
These were boys who were probably just visiting Berlin for the day.

00:15:46.480 --> 00:15:48.840
Informing was officially encouraged.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:50.080
Colleagues,

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:50.640
neighbors,

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:51.440
acquaintances.

00:15:52.000 --> 00:15:52.800
From that point on,

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:55.680
homosexuals had to be wary of everyone.

00:15:56.960 --> 00:15:59.080
The press ramped up its homophobic attacks.

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:05.320
The trial of wine merchant Leopold Obermeyer was the subject of a terrible smear campaign.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:12.520
It also enabled the Nazis to establish a dubious link between Jewishness and homosexuality.

00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:15.480
On September 1st,

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:16.800
1935,

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:19.720
Paragraph 175 was amended.

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:23.480
It was no longer only sexual relations that were punished.

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.240
A simple embrace,

00:16:25.640 --> 00:16:27.600
or even an admission of desire,

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:29.360
could result in a conviction.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:33.240
In cases of seduction of a minor or prostitution,

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.880
the penalty could be increased to 10 years hard labor.

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:41.880
Heinrich Himmler,

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:45.080
head of the SS and all police and security forces,

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.320
was certainly homosexuality's biggest enemy.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.040
He was obsessed with hunting them down.

00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:53.160
On October 10,

00:16:53.160 --> 00:16:54.280
1936,

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:59.320
he created the Central Office for the Combating of Homosexuality and Abortion.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.760
Within the Reich's criminal police,

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:04.920
led by Joseph Messinger,

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:08.520
who was already in charge of such matters at the Gestapo headquarters,

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:12.680
the office now centralized all files on identified cases.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.080
Everywhere in Germany,

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.880
the hunt intensified.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:28.600
In 1935,

00:17:28.600 --> 00:17:32.000
there were 2,100 convictions under paragraph 175.

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.120
In 1936,

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:36.720
the number reached over 5,000.

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.560
In each of the following years,

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:42.080
1937 and 1938,

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:45.520
over 8,000 sentences were handed down.

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:50.920
Considered to be enemies of the state,

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:55.920
homosexuals could even be incarcerated without a trial in a concentration camp.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:58.160
as a preventative measure.

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:06.000
With the expansion of the Reich and the outbreak of the Second World War,

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:10.640
Nazi policies against homosexuals varied from territory to territory.

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:13.960
In general,

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:18.040
the German Criminal Code only applied to Reich nationals,

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:18.840
Germans,

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.480
and inhabitants of annexed territories.

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:23.080
However,

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:26.760
Placed under the direct authority of a high-ranking Nazi,

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:33.080
the Netherlands introduced the equivalent of paragraph 175 in 1940.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:39.800
The young Tymon Hoffman was informed on and arrested at the age of 16.

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:44.760
A simple address book he was found carrying turned his life upside down.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.120
And then I heard one detective saying to the other,

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:51.240
well,

00:18:51.320 --> 00:18:52.160
we're on the right track.

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:54.840
Because this has names in it that we know too.

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:57.840
So you're sitting in your cell,

00:18:58.320 --> 00:19:00.080
and out of fear you don't dare do anything.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:04.080
I spent three days there.

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:09.840
And in those three days I was taken upstairs again and again.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.960
And I believe that on the third day they said,

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:15.480
