following the defeat of the French army,

00:37:30.480 --> 00:37:33.320
Hitler decided to annex Alsace and Moselle.

00:37:36.960 --> 00:37:40.840
Returned to France in 1919 under the Treaty of Versailles,

00:37:41.280 --> 00:37:45.320
these territories once again belonged de facto to the German Reich.

00:37:48.600 --> 00:37:50.760
So far spared by French criminal law,

00:37:51.280 --> 00:37:55.280
the region's homosexuals were now being hunted down by the police.

00:37:56.520 --> 00:37:58.040
From 1942 onwards,

00:37:58.520 --> 00:38:01.080
German legislation was officially enforced,

00:38:01.760 --> 00:38:03.440
paving the way for their prosecution.

00:38:05.400 --> 00:38:11.160
Alsace's special status meant that it hosted the only Nazi concentration camp on French soil,

00:38:11.920 --> 00:38:12.520
Struthof,

00:38:13.000 --> 00:38:17.480
located at an altitude of 800 meters in the heart of the Vosges Mountains.

00:38:20.400 --> 00:38:24.760
Nearly 300 people deported for homosexuality were detained there during the war.

00:38:26.320 --> 00:38:26.760
However,

00:38:26.960 --> 00:38:28.320
the vast majority of them,

00:38:28.840 --> 00:38:29.400
over 90%,

00:38:30.480 --> 00:38:31.240
came from Germany.

00:38:35.160 --> 00:38:37.320
When not deported to free France,

00:38:37.600 --> 00:38:44.440
Alsatians and Moselle residents arrested for homosexuality were generally incarcerated in security camps,

00:38:46.240 --> 00:38:47.880
sometimes without a trial.

00:38:50.080 --> 00:38:52.400
Just a few kilometers away from Stutthof,

00:38:53.280 --> 00:39:00.800
the Vorbruch-Scherbeck safety camp alone held more than a hundred prisoners on homosexuality charges during the war.

00:39:03.840 --> 00:39:05.080
Like Joseph Regisseur,

00:39:05.920 --> 00:39:09.240
a Strasbourg merchant who was sent to the camp after serving a

00:39:09.600 --> 00:39:11.840
30-month sentence in Strasbourg and Germany.

00:39:14.720 --> 00:39:15.560
Or Pierre Siel,

00:39:16.080 --> 00:39:20.240
a young sales apprentice arrested in 1941 in Malouz.

00:39:22.800 --> 00:39:23.960
He was only 17.

00:39:26.480 --> 00:39:27.440
In his memoirs,

00:39:27.880 --> 00:39:31.720
he describes the terrible conditions of the Volvrukschermek camp.

00:39:32.800 --> 00:39:33.320
Insults,

00:39:33.840 --> 00:39:34.520
deprivation,

00:39:34.840 --> 00:39:35.360
abuse.

00:39:36.440 --> 00:39:41.000
He even describes how he watched helplessly as his boyfriend was executed.

00:39:44.760 --> 00:39:47.800
Two SS men brought a young man to the center of our square.

00:39:49.120 --> 00:39:49.680
Horrified,

00:39:50.040 --> 00:39:50.960
I recognized Joe,

00:39:51.560 --> 00:39:52.320
my loving friend,

00:39:53.080 --> 00:39:54.680
who was only 18 years old.

00:39:56.120 --> 00:39:59.560
Then the loudspeakers broadcast some noisy classical music.

00:40:00.240 --> 00:40:03.840
while the SS stripped him naked and shoved a tin pail over his head.

00:40:05.720 --> 00:40:06.080
Next,

00:40:06.520 --> 00:40:08.880
they sicced their ferocious German shepherds on him.

00:40:09.840 --> 00:40:10.800
The guard dogs first

00:40:10.840 --> 00:40:13.160
First bit into his groin and thighs,

00:40:13.960 --> 00:40:15.800
then devoured him right in front of us.

00:40:17.560 --> 00:40:20.520
I will never forget that barbaric murder of my love.

00:40:24.360 --> 00:40:25.280
After six months,

00:40:25.720 --> 00:40:28.440
Pierre Seal was summoned to the camp commander's office.

00:40:29.520 --> 00:40:31.000
Just as he feared the worst,

00:40:31.600 --> 00:40:35.320
he was surprised to learn he was being released on good behavior.

00:40:37.120 --> 00:40:39.880
I could now become a full-fledged German citizen.

00:40:40.760 --> 00:40:44.200
I would even be permitted to say Heil Hitler when leaving his office,

00:40:44.960 --> 00:40:47.800
a privilege reserved for well-behaved men in the Reich.

00:40:51.200 --> 00:40:53.280
But this freedom would be short-lived.

00:40:53.960 --> 00:40:56.120
Like other Alsatian malgré nous,

00:40:56.800 --> 00:41:03.160
Pierre Siel was soon forcibly conscripted into the Wehrmacht and sent to the front in Yugoslavia and Russia.

00:41:05.280 --> 00:41:07.920
So it was off to war at 18 and a half,

00:41:08.800 --> 00:41:10.080
and in a German uniform.

00:41:12.240 --> 00:41:18.320
The horrors I had already seen and suffered in the concentration camp would be inflicted on me throughout Europe.

00:41:21.040 --> 00:41:22.000
For three years,

00:41:22.720 --> 00:41:25.200
I became a ghost in the service of death.

00:41:33.520 --> 00:41:37.360
Among other Alsatian homosexuals who were victims of Nazi repression,

00:41:38.200 --> 00:41:39.080
Robert Stelter,

00:41:39.400 --> 00:41:40.280
a vineyard worker.

00:41:41.360 --> 00:41:43.400
After a stint in Vorburg-Schirmeck,

00:41:43.680 --> 00:41:45.160
he was deported to Struthof,

00:41:45.560 --> 00:41:46.360
then Buchenwald,

00:41:46.720 --> 00:41:47.560
and finally Dora,

00:41:48.120 --> 00:41:49.080
where he met his death.

00:41:51.280 --> 00:41:51.720
Albert B.,

00:41:52.080 --> 00:41:53.400
a chemist from Strasbourg,

00:41:53.800 --> 00:41:57.440
served a two-year sentence in Alsace and various German prisons.

00:41:58.920 --> 00:41:59.840
Jean Oswald,

00:42:00.200 --> 00:42:02.000
another young laborer from Mulhouse,

00:42:02.320 --> 00:42:04.880
died at Struthof in June 1944.

00:42:08.880 --> 00:42:09.920
In the rest of France,

00:42:09.920 --> 00:42:13.280
around a hundred people were persecuted because of their homosexuality.

00:42:14.640 --> 00:42:15.760
In occupied France,

00:42:15.800 --> 00:42:18.720
the Nazis had little concern for these decadents,

00:42:19.080 --> 00:42:22.360
who they felt were helping to weaken the rest of the population.

00:42:24.280 --> 00:42:29.880
The few cases recorded mainly concerned men suspected of having slept with German soldiers.

00:42:33.640 --> 00:42:34.320
Lucien P.

00:42:34.960 --> 00:42:37.800
was a singer in Parisian cabarets such as Monaco,

00:42:38.240 --> 00:42:39.840
Loublanc and Pigalle's.

00:42:40.800 --> 00:42:42.640
He was part of a threesome with John T.,

00:42:43.200 --> 00:42:44.640
a clothing store salesman,

00:42:45.240 --> 00:42:46.280
and Karl Schwerbel,

00:42:46.880 --> 00:42:47.880
an SS official.

00:42:47.880 --> 00:42:54.320
In 1941,

00:42:54.520 --> 00:42:56.160
all three men are arrested.

00:42:57.400 --> 00:43:01.920
Schwerbel was sent back to Germany and incarcerated in Sachsenhausen.

00:43:04.640 --> 00:43:08.640
The two Frenchmen were incarcerated for over two years in the Paris region,

00:43:09.360 --> 00:43:12.200
before finally being deported to the Buchenwald camp.

00:43:15.280 --> 00:43:17.120
While shooting the film Mermoz,

00:43:17.560 --> 00:43:25.800
homosexual actor Robert Hugues Lambert was caught in a raid in a Parisian café in 1943.

00:43:25.800 --> 00:43:30.440
He was accused of idleness and said to have had an affair with a German officer.

00:43:31.560 --> 00:43:32.920
He too was deported.

00:43:33.480 --> 00:43:36.400
and died in Flossenburg at the age of 36.

00:43:41.760 --> 00:43:42.800
To protect minors,

00:43:43.120 --> 00:43:47.240
the Vichy regime passed a discriminatory law in 1942,

00:43:48.080 --> 00:43:52.400
setting the age of sexual majority at 21 for homosexual men and women,

00:43:53.040 --> 00:43:55.720
compared with 13 for heterosexuals.

00:43:57.440 --> 00:43:57.800
However,

00:43:57.800 --> 00:44:00.240
this law seems to have had limited impact.

00:44:00.760 --> 00:44:01.520
On the other hand,

00:44:01.840 --> 00:44:03.040
Starting in 1940,

00:44:03.440 --> 00:44:07.080
many homosexuals were arrested in the name of moral order.

00:44:09.880 --> 00:44:10.480
In the end,

00:44:10.880 --> 00:44:18.160
at least 40 of them were subjected to administrative internment in supervised residence camps in unoccupied zones.

00:44:20.280 --> 00:44:22.560
At Fort Barreau in the Isère department,

00:44:23.000 --> 00:44:26.120
or the Citadel of Cisteron in the Basse-Alpes region,

00:44:29.240 --> 00:44:31.200
most have criminal records.

00:44:31.720 --> 00:44:32.440
prostitutes,

00:44:32.480 --> 00:44:33.240
petty criminals,

00:44:33.760 --> 00:44:37.880
and rubbed shoulders with political opponents and delinquents of all kinds.

00:44:41.440 --> 00:44:42.200
Henry Pasca,

00:44:42.720 --> 00:44:44.920
known as Fleur de Thé from Nice,

00:44:45.320 --> 00:44:46.440
was 20 years old,

00:44:46.920 --> 00:44:48.440
with no known occupation,

00:44:48.920 --> 00:44:50.520
and was well known to the police.

00:44:51.640 --> 00:44:53.960
He was detained in Cisterone in 1940,

00:44:54.480 --> 00:44:56.080
Fort Barreau two years later,

00:44:56.520 --> 00:44:59.200
and then deported to Buchenwald in 1944.

00:45:11.800 --> 00:45:13.160
In the concentration camps,

00:45:13.840 --> 00:45:19.640
homosexual prisoners were often used as guinea pigs for experiments on diphtheria,

00:45:20.240 --> 00:45:21.120
typhoid fever,

00:45:21.480 --> 00:45:22.200
or malaria.

00:45:26.440 --> 00:45:29.320
Castrations were also sometimes performed.

00:45:31.400 --> 00:45:32.840
Karl-Heinz Rodenberg,

00:45:33.240 --> 00:45:34.000
neurologist,

00:45:34.120 --> 00:45:34.920
psychiatrist,

00:45:35.160 --> 00:45:40.600
and scientific director of the Reich Central Office for the Combating of Homosexuality and Abortion,

00:45:41.360 --> 00:45:47.280
claimed that forced castration was the surest way to protect society from the urges of homosexuals.

00:45:50.160 --> 00:45:52.000
Starting in 1939,

00:45:52.000 --> 00:45:59.720
voluntary castration was sometimes offered to homosexual inmates in return for the promise of a hypothetical release.

00:46:01.920 --> 00:46:10.120
Himmler now stipulated that any homosexual who consented to castration and whose conduct was good would shortly be released from concentration camp.

00:46:11.120 --> 00:46:19.360
Many of the Pink Triangle prisoners actually believed Himmler's promises and consented to castration with a view to escaping their murderous persecutions.

00:46:20.320 --> 00:46:21.400
But when they were released,

00:46:21.760 --> 00:46:31.200
this was only to be sent to the SS Dürrlewanger Penal Division on the Russian front to be butchered in the partisan war and die a hero's death for Hitler and Himmler.

00:46:31.200 --> 00:46:35.880
In 1944,

00:46:36.280 --> 00:46:40.640
Danish endocrinologist Carl Vernet was integrated into the SS.

00:46:40.840 --> 00:46:45.240
to conduct an experimental sexual polarity reversal program.

00:46:48.000 --> 00:46:53.560
He convinced Himmler that it was possible to cure homosexuals with an artificial gland implant.

00:46:55.240 --> 00:46:57.880
By releasing male hormones into their bodies,

00:46:58.400 --> 00:47:00.880
it would modify their sexual orientation.

00:47:05.120 --> 00:47:06.040
At the end of the year,

00:47:06.560 --> 00:47:10.040
experiments were conducted for several weeks at the camp in Buchenwald.

00:47:12.000 --> 00:47:19.640
The artificial gland effects were then thoroughly analyzed on about 15 patients between the ages of 23 and 55.

00:47:37.960 --> 00:47:38.080
For

00:47:38.080 --> 00:47:41.160
the German homosexuals who survived the Nazi atrocities,

00:47:41.680 --> 00:47:46.480
The end of the war and release from the camps did not mean the end of their torments.

00:47:51.280 --> 00:47:53.880
Paragraph 175 wasn't abolished,

00:47:54.400 --> 00:47:57.960
and male homosexuality continued to be considered a crime.

00:48:02.640 --> 00:48:05.240
They were often denied the status of Nazi victims,

00:48:06.000 --> 00:48:08.360
as was the case with artist Richard Gruner,

00:48:08.840 --> 00:48:11.480
a survivor of Sachsenhausen and Flossenburg,

00:48:11.480 --> 00:48:18.200
who in 1946 produced an album of lithographs documenting the horrors of the camps.

00:48:24.200 --> 00:48:26.240
Many of them were sent to prison again.

00:48:27.360 --> 00:48:28.840
Arrested in 1938,

00:48:29.400 --> 00:48:31.760
imprisoned in Neuengam and then Auschwitz,

00:48:32.040 --> 00:48:32.760
and Mauthausen,

00:48:33.440 --> 00:48:37.240
Nurse Karl Gorath was re-arrested in 1947.

00:48:38.440 --> 00:48:43.640
He faced the same judge as under the Nazis and was re-sentenced to five years.

00:48:48.480 --> 00:48:51.120
As for the former torturers of homosexuals,

00:48:51.600 --> 00:48:53.480
their post-war fates varied.

00:48:54.520 --> 00:48:56.160
Taken prisoner by the Allies,

00:48:56.640 --> 00:48:58.880
Heinrich Himmler committed s****** on May 22nd,

00:48:58.880 --> 00:49:00.880
1945.

00:49:02.640 --> 00:49:03.520
Joseph Messinger,

00:49:03.640 --> 00:49:09.680
who was in charge of the Reich Central Office for the Combating of Homosexuality and Abortion upon its creation,

00:49:10.080 --> 00:49:16.760
was finally convicted in Poland for his role in the destruction of the Warsaw Ghetto and hanged on March 7,

00:49:16.760 --> 00:49:18.320
1947.

00:49:20.320 --> 00:49:21.040
On the other hand,

00:49:21.400 --> 00:49:23.040
no charges were brought against Dr.

00:49:23.080 --> 00:49:23.680
Rodenberg,

00:49:24.000 --> 00:49:27.440
a major player in the sterilization and castration programs.

00:49:28.240 --> 00:49:30.400
He continued to practice medicine in Germany.

00:49:30.760 --> 00:49:33.960
and died in 1995 at the age of 91.

00:49:36.960 --> 00:49:38.120
As for Carl Vernet,

00:49:38.440 --> 00:49:43.320
he always denied having experimented with his artificial gland on Buchenwald inmates.

00:49:46.080 --> 00:49:50.280
After registering the patent and attempting to market it to pharmaceutical companies,

00:49:50.720 --> 00:49:53.560
he finally fled to Argentina in 1946,

00:49:54.120 --> 00:49:55.520
where he died 20 years later.

00:50:03.120 --> 00:50:04.200
For several decades,

00:50:04.520 --> 00:50:08.280
Nazi persecution of homosexuals remained a taboo topic,

00:50:09.600 --> 00:50:10.800
forgotten by officials.

00:50:10.800 --> 00:50:11.280
In the history,

00:50:11.760 --> 00:50:15.560
most victims continue to keep silent about their experiences.

00:50:18.080 --> 00:50:22.800
Austrian Joseph Coutt was the first to tell the story for the general public.

00:50:25.240 --> 00:50:26.560
Men with the Pink Triangle,

00:50:26.640 --> 00:50:30.640
published in 1972 under the pseudonym of Heinz Heger,

00:50:31.360 --> 00:50:37.800
describes the six years he spent in the camps and how difficult it was to find his place in society after the war.

00:50:39.640 --> 00:50:41.440
In the early days after my homecoming,

00:50:41.680 --> 00:50:45.640
the neighbors made a bit of a fuss about this queer concentration camp returnee.

00:50:47.160 --> 00:50:49.120
And what had I done to be sent off this way?

00:50:49.760 --> 00:50:51.960
What infamous crime or damage to the community?

00:50:52.720 --> 00:50:58.120
What does it say about the world we live in if an adult man is told how and whom he should love?

00:51:03.840 --> 00:51:08.720
Homosexuality was finally decriminalized in East Germany in 1968.

00:51:09.400 --> 00:51:11.200
and in West Germany the following year.

00:51:12.480 --> 00:51:12.880
However,

00:51:13.000 --> 00:51:19.400
it wasn't until 1994 that paragraph 175 disappeared from the criminal code altogether.

00:51:23.680 --> 00:51:24.160
In the early

00:51:25.040 --> 00:51:28.040
1970s, thanks to LGBT associations,

00:51:28.240 --> 00:51:30.320
Remembrance work finally began.

00:51:32.480 --> 00:51:37.280
The story of the homosexual victims of Nazism was featured in articles,

00:51:37.360 --> 00:51:37.880
debates,

00:51:39.040 --> 00:51:40.600
Survivor accounts were collected.

00:51:44.960 --> 00:51:45.360
Finally,

00:51:46.000 --> 00:51:46.720
on May 17th,

00:51:46.720 --> 00:51:47.840
2002,

00:51:48.440 --> 00:51:51.000
the Bundestag voted for their rehabilitation.

00:51:52.240 --> 00:51:53.400
And in 2008,

00:51:53.800 --> 00:52:04.840
the memorial dedicated to them in the heart of Berlin soberly but forcefully affirms the right of gays and lesbians from now on to love as they choose.

00:52:08.800 --> 00:52:13.320
Sometimes from time there are so very heavy thoughts.

00:52:14.120 --> 00:52:14.800
Even now,

00:52:15.440 --> 00:52:15.560
me,

00:52:15.920 --> 00:52:16.160
I am

00:52:16.720 --> 00:52:18.080
71. Who knows,

00:52:18.280 --> 00:52:19.320
maybe tomorrow,

00:52:19.400 --> 00:52:23.000
after tomorrow I'll die and there will be no documentation.

00:52:23.680 --> 00:52:26.280
It must be for the young people.

00:52:26.800 --> 00:52:27.160
You see,

00:52:27.280 --> 00:52:28.200
as I told you,

00:52:28.880 --> 00:52:29.600
I cannot,

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:31.000
I can forgive,

00:52:31.320 --> 00:52:32.320
but not forget.

00:52:32.720 --> 00:52:34.200
Especially for the young.

00:52:34.560 --> 00:52:36.920
They must know how it was.

